[Trigger]
Name	reedCall
Mode	once
Cond	time	3
Action	message	1	Hollin Fen is a bog of holly thickets, master, and its convent has more soldiers than nuns. Sister Agathe Hollin keeps every door shut and sends out patrols without rest.
Action	objective	1	Kill Sister Agathe Hollin in the convent chapel.
Action	objective	1	Hold your heart against the convent patrols.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	fenEntered
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Fen
Action	message	1	The bog swallows heavy boots. Keep your creatures on the dry ground between the thickets.
Action	reveal	1	EastBank
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	gold1
Mode	once
Cond	mined	1	>=	1200
Action	message	1	With this gold you can afford stronger doors and a few bridges over the soft ground.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	cairnSeen
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Cairn
Action	message	1	These cairns mark an old burial ground. Prisoners taken here can be put to work.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	causewayHeld
Mode	once
Cond	claimed	1	Causeway	40
Action	message	1	The causeway cave is yours and the convent west gate is within reach.
Action	reveal	1	Ward
Action	objective	1	Break through the west gate of the convent ward.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	wardEntered
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Ward
Action	message	1	Every bell in the convent is tolling. Sister Agathe has called out her whole guard.
Action	spawn	3	56	56	1	Knight:3	Knight:2	Elf:2	Monk:2	Adventurer:2
Action	reveal	1	Chapel
Action	objective	1	Reach the chapel and strike down the warden.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	hollowFound
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	SealedHollow
Action	message	1	The sisters bricked this hollow up. A pale stone sits in the wall niche, and a lost goblin has lifted it. Bring it to your dungeon heart.
Action	spawn	1	6	54	1	Goblin:1@HollowBearer
Action	stoneattach	HollowBearer
Action	setflag	hollowStone	1
Action	timer	hollowSpawn	0
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	hollowStoneHome
Mode	once
Cond	reached	HollowBearer	heart	1
Action	message	1	The pale stone sinks into the heart and a hidden hall has opened.
Action	discover	campaign/CrowshotGallery.level
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	hollowStoneLost
Mode	repeat	60
Cond	flag	hollowStone	1
Cond	timer	hollowSpawn	>=	5
Cond	alive	HollowBearer	0
Action	message	1	The stone-bearer has fallen. Another goblin has lifted the stone in the hollow.
Action	spawn	1	6	54	1	Goblin:1@HollowBearer
Action	stoneattach	HollowBearer
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	fenDrains
Mode	once
Cond	claimed	1	Fen	120
Action	message	1	With so much of the fen under your claim, the reed pool has drained and a spring of raw mana has surfaced beside it.
Action	terrain	27	35	33	37	path
Action	terrain	38	36	38	36	manawell	1
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	patrol1
Mode	once
Cond	time	240
Action	message	1	A patrol of the convent is wading through the bog.
Action	spawn	3	38	14	1	Adventurer:2	Adventurer:2	Dwarf1:2	Elf:2
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
